Emerging Market Opportunities
The transition toward AI-ready data centre infrastructure is creating opportunities for specialised retrofit contractors and engineering firms. Providers offering end-to-end services—from thermal architecture and installation to commissioning and lifecycle support—can address a broader range of customer requirements.

Phased retrofits also offer potential for recurring service engagements. As operators expand liquid cooling across additional racks and facilities, demand may increase for ongoing inspections, system optimisation, technical documentation, and maintenance.

Regional Market Insights
North America dominated the global market in 2025, accounting for an estimated 42% share. The region benefits from an established data centre ecosystem, hyperscale infrastructure investment, and a concentration of specialist cooling suppliers.

Europe represents an important market supported by data centre engineering capabilities and demand for efficient facility operations. Asia-Pacific is positioned for further development as data centre capacity expands across China and India. Latin America and the Middle East and Africa also present opportunities as operators evaluate infrastructure upgrades and higher-density computing requirements.

